{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36468","headline":"溪上春望 · 罗邺","name":"溪上春望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无端溪上看兰桡，又是东风断柳条。\n双鬓多於愁里镊，四时须向醉中销。\n行人骏马嘶香陌，独我残阳倚野桥。\n吟水咏山心未已，可能终不胜渔樵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36468.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36468","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}